# Active compose profiles — add as hardware arrives, comma-separated.
# Core services (broker, signing, provisioning, ros2_app) ALWAYS run.
#   drive    -> micro-ROS agent for the drive ESP32   (needs /dev/esp_drive)
#   sensors  -> micro-ROS agent for the sensors ESP32 (needs /dev/esp_sensors)
#   camera   -> web_video_server                      (needs a camera publishing)
# Example when everything is plugged in:
#   COMPOSE_PROFILES=drive,sensors,camera
COMPOSE_PROFILES=
